# Local configuration (SDK path, signing, secrets)
# The release signing key stays OUT of the repository — it lives as a base64 GitHub Actions secret
# (KEYSTORE_BASE64) that CI decodes to a temp file. Only its certificate fingerprint is committed, in
# signing-fingerprint.txt, so CI can fail if the key ever changes. See .github/workflows/build.yml.
local.properties
keystore/
keystore.properties
*.jks
*.keystore
secrets.properties

